{"title":"2021 WSMO Accuracy Round Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_WSMO_Accuracy_Round_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The largest value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> that satisfies the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/9/939b290428e1111678574f231a364856e86ac691.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5x^2-7\\lfloor x\\rfloor\\{x\\}=\\frac{26\\lfloor x\\rfloor^2}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"196\" height=\"41\" /> can be expressed as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/0/2d0f5d72741e1b57a8ac058d675f1621a5798bb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a+b\\sqrt{c}}{d}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"65\" height=\"39\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> is a squarefree positive integer and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/4/a643bcc8195884f4fc1e16966f6f3d6ad6fe2c27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"18\" /> are relatively prime positive integers. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/4/e947add5766b9f26f6dfe73d9425d87664416459.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c+d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_WSMO_Accuracy_Round_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/a/b8a8c38f37a80c0447d72d36437c74d169861aa3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=\\lfloor x\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"62\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/9/bb91f2df26224941970dd708ffab907652e0680c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=\\{x\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"62\" height=\"20\" />. The equation is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092915af019aa35dad301a69bad0a71a0fe2940f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5(a+b)^2-7ab=\\frac{26a^2}{5}\\implies a^2-15ab-25b^2=0\\implies \\frac{a}{b}=\\frac{15+5\\sqrt{13}}{2}.\\]\" width=\"540\" height=\"41\" /> Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/9/5892a1821a8d90497752d63ae6280e9a722190b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is maximized when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/e/c5e177b6fb943fce274e347030cad7b64d4e2304.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{15+5\\sqrt{13}}{2}\\right\\rfloor=16\\implies b=\\frac{32}{15+5\\sqrt{13}}.\\]\" width=\"357\" height=\"53\" /> So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/3/0f3f416a3d441d56b87d56e31f1f70542f072dc5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=a=b=16+\\frac{32}{15+5\\sqrt{13}}=\\frac{56+8\\sqrt{13}}{5}\\implies 56+8+13+5=\\boxed{82}.\\]\" width=\"538\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p>~pinkpig\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_WSMO_Accuracy_Round_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/e/6befe5bb5b33563c33785b1e5e9e29932263f39e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor x \\rfloor = n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"61\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/f/0ffe84e5ac2edd226bb3bece1b998e28d8f239ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{x\\} = r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"63\" height=\"20\" />. Plugging this into our equation yields:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/7/c7773fe76dfecab597217a35c53354fda9fd1c12.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5(n+r)^2-7nr=\\frac{26n^2}{5}\\]\" width=\"186\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/0/3800a801d03bdea675c7e6abb47581ec1cdff487.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Rightarrow 25r^2 + 15rn - n^2 = 0\\]\" width=\"190\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/d/35d8bb20bfb6cd22fe085945546f74a3e3c405c4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Rightarrow r = \\frac{n(\\pm \\sqrt{13}-3)}{10}\\]\" width=\"161\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><br />\nWe are finding the largest <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, so we try to maximize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />. Assume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/4/0247db3d702b5ce6be98f50771750a2723cddcea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/c/3ccb381ec185582e55793e7d76c99eba3ea18ce3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=\\{x\\}\\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"97\" height=\"20\" />, we take <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/b/57b628c175e4daf3226bd44b1b41eaaa5e9fdb99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = \\frac{n(\\sqrt{13}-3)}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"128\" height=\"43\" />. Note that:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/e/a6e5d053e2111682c617a9070c9bbff3eaf44c99.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[0 \\leq r &lt; 1\\]\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/5/955b4981ff5a1af3a01c64986d953c57f4aa8ac3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Rightarrow 0 \\leq \\frac{n(\\sqrt{13}-3)}{10} &lt; 1\\]\" width=\"182\" height=\"41\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/b/e4b5f2c10547e02a12dfad4db5a1e74a37849c61.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Rightarrow 0 \\leq n &lt; \\frac{5(\\sqrt{13}+3)}{2}\\]\" width=\"181\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><br />\nNotice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/7/7e7af0f969c4c35dfe85c167c00a74c0faa7c46a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5(\\sqrt{9}+3)}{2} &lt; \\frac{5(\\sqrt{13}+3)}{2} &lt; \\frac{5(\\sqrt{16}+3)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"317\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/1/3e164f71b1324aa6a8c79141d458db931be0eddb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow 15 &lt; \\frac{5(\\sqrt{13}+3)}{2} &lt; 17.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"216\" height=\"43\" />. We start by checking <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/e/30e5a50f89eb87941facbb1e7b1ae91777fa10f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=17$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"53\" height=\"12\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/b/f8be1e454a06056c5882b2436b78c5d59019f629.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[r = \\frac{n(\\sqrt{13}-3)}{10}\\]\" width=\"124\" height=\"41\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/c/bcc65e1d556a370b150747c69229222737d62132.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Rightarrow r = \\frac{17(\\sqrt{13}-3)}{10}\\]\" width=\"154\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><br />\nThis solution is valid if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/7/ea783cd25a8aed2b5700cd89bcc3de972ef18a47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\leq r &lt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/a/bdae0e71b759d63f6b04cf8103c0a23707aab054.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{17(\\sqrt{13}-3)}{10} &lt; 1\\]\" width=\"131\" height=\"41\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/9/75960d2764ece24f5c943cdecec0986c258279c2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Rightarrow 17\\sqrt{13} &lt; 61\\]\" width=\"115\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/4/f04aa8efb71ed1533e81bc5a279d193eaae772cf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Rightarrow 17^2 \\cdot 13 &lt; 61^2\\]\" width=\"128\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/b/52b2d483b66d52e25b8bb8cd9089563a0f808281.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Rightarrow 3757 &lt; 3721\\]\" width=\"118\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><br />\nThis is clearly false, so we now check <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/7/c874a6ca8456dd226bf716c2edfdd97d1bfd7665.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" />. Using the same method as before,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/5/1e5ac75fd186f4ba5a7c01900a37e7c5b48b3312.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[r = \\frac{16(\\sqrt{13}-3)}{10} &lt; 1\\]\" width=\"165\" height=\"41\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/d/00d10a584ae7ee501b244b060fd04b39a9930794.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Rightarrow 16\\sqrt{13} &lt; 58\\]\" width=\"116\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/5/fe5294fd402a9d401fc2f046c213a959bcfd0bca.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Rightarrow 3328 &lt; 3364\\]\" width=\"119\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><br />\nThis is true, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/1/d61a039799dc3c71ee1d03a6e7889f84d5a37efa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = n+r = 16 + \\frac{16(\\sqrt{13}-3)}{10} = \\frac{56 + 8\\sqrt{13}}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"355\" height=\"43\" />, giving us an answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/f/def9ecd5cb0551012f494ca4cc93e81a732b45e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$56+8+13+5 = \\boxed{82}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"177\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~BigKahuna227\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018020314\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.027 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 160/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8049/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:22506:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018020314 and revision id 274595. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}